scene prologue:
  me "Dark..."
  me "I'm not sure why, but everything is dark in here."
  me "Don't remember when I arrived, can't remember or understand my own body in this place."
  me "This place where I can't see anything"
  "Suddenly, a small light appears before me"
  unknown_1 "Remember..."
  unknown_1 "You must remember"

  call remember_name player_name

  unknown_1 "Can't believe you slept for so long {player_name}"
  unknown_1 "We almost got late because of you"
  "I rub my eyes"
  show kaede annoyed at center with dissolve
  kaede "What are you doing still on your bed, hurry up already"
  {player_name} "What ?"
  kaede "What do you mean 'what' ? Get up already, we're late for the academy"
  "As if my body remembers what I must do, I get up, look at the closet near the door, and cover my eyes with my hands before turning back."
  {player_name} "The sun is barely up, what do you mean late ? We'll arrive earlier than everyone"
  show kaede cheerful with dissolve
  kaede "Stop complaining, if we're aiming at the council, we need to be earlier than anyone."
  "Council ? Academy ? What are we talking about ?"
  "Still, I must mask my state, I'm not sure I understand things properly yet as I don't remember anything"
  {player_name} "Ok ok, just get out of my room, I will get ready fast."
  show kaede neutral with dissolve
  kaede "'Finally' She said as she left the room"
  remove kaede with dissolve
  "I must first get myself some clothes, and search anything essential until I remember who I am."
  


